From 2ecbfaf1f1f79cb2f318bf474f2195b66e1c9bd7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Armin Novak <armin.novak@thincast.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 11:46:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [winpr,clipboard] Add ClipboardRegisterSynthesizerEx

Refactor clipboard internal handling. ClipboardRegisterSynthesizer does
call the synthesizer with the format of the data in the clipboard, which
is also accessible from wClipboard but fails to pass the synthesized
format ID. This limits usefulness of the callback as there needs to be
one for each target format.

ClipboardRegisterSynthesizerEx calls the synthesizer with the format to
synthesize, so now you got source and destination formats available and
can convert them however desired.
